<p>bano ke sheer qaar ko haftum se pyaas hai<br />
bachhe ki nabz dekh ke maa be-hawaas hai<br />
ne doodh hai naa paani ke milne ki aas hai<br />
phirti hai aas paas ye jeene se yaas hai</p>

<p>kehti thi kya karoo'n mai duhaayi hussain ki<br />
putli phiri hai aaj mere noor-e- ain ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>faryaad ya ali mai kidhar jaau'n ya ali<br />
in daaghou'n ko kaha'n se jigar laau'n ya ali<br />
kis tarha inki saans ko tehraau'n ya ali<br />
paani ka qahat hai mai kahan paau'n ya ali</p>

<p>pichli ko aankh khole the ab kholte nahi<br />
rote nahi humakte nahi bolte nahi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aaqir kaha ye sab ne, bulaao imaam ko<br />
laao khuda ke waaste laao imaam ko<br />
is bezabaa'n ka haal sunaao imaam ko<br />
neeli rage'n gale ki dikhaao imaam ko</p>

<p>akbar ki laash le gaye hai qatlgaah me<br />
koi pukar lo woh abhi honge raah me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mu par jawaa'n bete ka taza lahu lagaaye<br />
matam saraa me ganje shahidaa'n se shaah aaye<br />
jhule pa haath pakde huwe ahlebait laye<br />
bachche ke haath paau'n hila kar inhe dikhaaye</p>

<p>rokar kaha ke sans faqat aashkaar hai<br />
ho iska kya hisaab ke dam ka shumaar hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baithe sarhaane jhule ke shabbir sar jhukaaye<br />
asghar ke kaan se lab-e moujiz numa milaaye<br />
chupke se kuch kaha ke wo sunte hi muskuraaye<br />
soo-e-hussain haath bhi be saaqta badhaaye</p>

<p>boli sakina baba ne mushkil kushaayi ki<br />
amma mubarak aankh khuli mere bhaai ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hathou pa isko leke chale shaah-e karbala<br />
aur saath saath goud ko khole huwe qazaa<br />
likha hai dhoop tezz thi aur garm thi hawa<br />
asghar pa maa ne daal di ujli si ek ridaa</p>

<p>chaadar na thi wo chahra-e pur aab-o- taab par<br />
tukda sufaid abr ka tha aaftaab par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pahonche qareeb-e- fouj to tyoraa ke reh gaye<br />
chaaha kare sawaal pa sharma ke reh gaye<br />
ghairat se rang udh gaya tharra ke rah gaye<br />
chaadar pisar ke chehre se sarka ke rah gaye</p>

<p>aankhe'n jhuka ke bole ye ham inko laaye hain<br />
asghar tumhaare paas gharaz leke aaye hain<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>phir hont bezubaan ke choome jhuka ke sar<br />
rokar kaha jo kahna tha so keh chuka pidar<br />
baaqi rahi na baat koi aye mere pisar<br />
sookhi zabaan tum bhi dikhado nikaal kar</p>

<p>pheri zaba'n labou pa jo is noor-e- ain ne<br />
tharra ke aasmaan ko dekha hussain ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>moula falak ko dekh rahe the ke naagahaa'n<br />
li hurmula ne shaane se do taank ki kamaa'n<br />
tarkash se jab ke khainch liya teer-e jaa'n sataa'n<br />
choda kamaan se taak-ke halqoome be zubaa'n</p>

<p>chut-te hi halq bachhe ka chedaa jo teer ne<br />
tharra ke aasman ko dekha sagheer ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kya sin tha teer khate hi bachha dahel gaya<br />
sookhe gale se khoon ka darya ubal gaya<br />
tadpa jo sheh ke hathoun pa to manka dhal gaya<br />
topi giri zameen pa aur dam nikal gaya</p>

<p>nanhi kalaiyo me tash-nujh se bal pade<br />
hichki jo aayi mu se angotte nikal pade<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mu aasmaa'n se sheh ne phiraya ke kya huwa<br />
dekha ke paar halq se teer-e jafaa huwa<br />
bachha tadap raha hai lahu me bhara huwa<br />
aur nanha haath zaqme gulu par dhara huwa</p>

<p>aankhe'n phiraaye dete hain tewar badalte hain<br />
aage to doodh ugle the ab khoo'n ugalte hain<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>khaincha gale se bachhe ke aahista sheh ne teer<br />
aur hatoun pe bulandh kiya laasha-e sagheer<br />
gardan jhuka ke bole ke aye qaaliq-e qadeer<br />
maqbool ho hussain ka ye fidya-e- aqeer</p>

<p>shashmaha koi kushta-e teere sitam nahi<br />
ye bezubaan naaqa-e saaleh se kam nahi<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>